#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:97
msgid "For more information:"
msgstr "Lisateave:"

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:89
msgid "Any information you provide will not be shared with service providers without your authorization."
msgstr "Sinu esitatud teavet ei jagata teenusepakkujatega ilma sinu loata."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:88
msgid "You may need to first sign up for an account with the service that you plan to use. When you do so, you would need to authorize Contact Form 7 to access the service with your account."
msgstr "Võimalik, et pead esmalt registreerima konto teenuses, mida plaanid kasutada. Seda tehes pead lubama Contact Form 7-l pääseda teenusele ligi sinu kontoga."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:87
msgid "On this screen, you can manage services that are available through Contact Form 7. Using API will allow you to collaborate with any services that are available."
msgstr "Sellel ekraanil saad hallata teenuseid, mis on saadaval Contact Form 7 kaudu. API kasutamine võimaldab sul teha koostööd kõigi saadaval olevate teenustega."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:85
msgid "There are also special mail-tags that have specific names, but do not have corresponding form-tags. They are used to represent meta information of form submissions like the submitter&#8217;s IP address or the URL of the page."
msgstr "Samuti on olemas spetsiaalsed e-posti sildid, millel on konkreetsed nimed, kuid millele ei vasta vormisilte. Neid kasutatakse vormi edastuste metaandmete esitamiseks, näiteks saatja IP-aadress või lehe URL."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:84
msgid "A mail-tag is also a short code enclosed in square brackets that you can use in every Mail and Mail (2) field. A mail-tag represents a user input value through an input field of a corresponding form-tag."
msgstr "Meilisilt on samuti nurksulgudesse paigutatud lühikood, mida saad kasutada igal väljal Mail ja Mail (2). Meilisilt tähistab kasutaja sisestatud väärtust vastava vormisildi sisestusvälja kaudu."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:82
msgid "While form-tags have a comparatively complex syntax, you do not need to know the syntax to add form-tags because you can use the straightforward tag generator (<strong>Generate Tag</strong> button on this screen)."
msgstr "Kuigi vormisiltidel on võrdlemisi keeruline süntaks, ei pea sa vormisiltide lisamiseks süntaksit tundma, sest saad kasutada lihtsat sildigeneraatorit (<strong>Loo silt</strong> nupp sellel kuval)."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:81
msgid "A form-tag is a short code enclosed in square brackets used in a form content. A form-tag generally represents an input field, and its components can be separated into four parts: type, name, options, and values. Contact Form 7 supports several types of form-tags including text fields, number fields, date fields, checkboxes, radio buttons, menus, file-uploading fields, CAPTCHAs, and quiz fields."
msgstr "Vormisilt on nurksulgudesse lisatud lühikood, mida kasutatakse vormi sisus. Vormisilt tähistab üldiselt sisestusvälja ning selle komponendid saab jagada neljaks osaks: tüüp, nimi, valikud ja väärtused. Contact Form 7 toetab mitut tüüpi vormisilte, sealhulgas tekstivälju, arvuvälju, kuupäevavälju, märkeruute, raadionuppe, menüüsid, failide üleslaadimise välju, CAPTCHA-sid ja viktoriinivälju."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:79
msgid "<strong>Additional Settings</strong> provides a place where you can customize the behavior of this contact form by adding code snippets."
msgstr "<strong>Lisaseaded</strong> pakub kohta, kus saad kohandada selle kontaktivormi käitumist, lisades koodilõike."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:78
msgid "In <strong>Messages</strong>, you can edit various types of messages used for this contact form. These messages are relatively short messages, like a validation error message you see when you leave a required field blank."
msgstr "Jaotises <strong>Sõnumid</strong> saad muuta selle kontaktivormi jaoks kasutatavaid eri tüüpi sõnumeid. Need sõnumid on suhteliselt lühikesed, näiteks valideerimisvea sõnum, mida näed, kui jätad kohustusliku välja tühjaks."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:77
msgid "<strong>Mail (2)</strong> is an additional mail template that works similar to Mail. Mail (2) is different in that it is sent only when Mail has been sent successfully."
msgstr "<strong>E-post (2)</strong> on täiendav e-posti mall, mis töötab sarnaselt e-postiga. E-post (2) erineb selle poolest, et see saadetakse ainult siis, kui e-post on edukalt saadetud."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:76
msgid "<strong>Mail</strong> manages a mail template (headers and message body) that this contact form will send when users submit it. You can use Contact Form 7&#8217;s mail-tags here."
msgstr "<strong>E-post</strong> haldab e-posti malli (päised ja sõnumi sisu), mille see kontaktivorm saadab, kui kasutajad selle esitavad. Siin saad kasutada Contact Form 7 e-posti silte."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:75
msgid "<strong>Form</strong> is a content of HTML form. You can use arbitrary HTML, which is allowed inside a form element. You can also use Contact Form 7&#8217;s form-tags here."
msgstr "<strong>Vorm</strong> on HTML-vormi sisu. Saad kasutada suvalist HTML-i, mis on lubatud vormielemendi sees. Siin saad kasutada ka Contact Form 7 vormisilte."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:74
msgid "<strong>Title</strong> is the title of a contact form. This title is only used for labeling a contact form, and can be edited."
msgstr "<strong>Pealkiri</strong> on kontaktivormi pealkiri. Seda pealkirja kasutatakse ainult kontaktivormi sildistamiseks ja seda saab muuta."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:73
msgid "On this screen, you can edit a contact form. A contact form is comprised of the following components:"
msgstr "Sellel ekraanil saad muuta kontaktivormi. Kontaktivorm koosneb järgmistest komponentidest:"

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:71
msgid "<strong>Duplicate</strong> - Clones that contact form. A cloned contact form inherits all content from the original, but has a different ID."
msgstr "<strong>Dubleeri</strong> – Kloonib selle kontaktivormi. Kloonitud kontaktivorm pärib kogu sisu originaalist, kuid sellel on erinev ID."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:70
msgid "<strong>Edit</strong> - Navigates to the editing screen for that contact form. You can also reach that screen by clicking on the contact form title."
msgstr "<strong>Muuda</strong> - Viib selle kontaktivormi muutmise kuvale. Sellele kuvale pääsed ka, klikkides kontaktivormi pealkirjal."

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:69
msgid "Hovering over a row in the contact forms list will display action links that allow you to manage your contact form. You can perform the following actions:"
msgstr "Kontaktivormide loendis real hõljutamine kuvab tegevuslingid, mis võimaldavad sul oma kontaktivormi hallata. Saad teha järgmisi toiminguid:"

#: admin/includes/help-tabs.php:67
msgid "On this screen, you can manage contact forms provided by Contact Form 7. You can manage an unlimited number of contact forms. Each contact form has a unique ID and Contact Form 7 shortcode ([contact-form-7 ...]). To insert a contact form into a post or a text widget, insert the shortcode into the target."
msgstr "Sellel ekraanil saad hallata Contact Form 7 pakutavaid kontaktivorme. Saad hallata piiramatul arvul kontaktivorme. Igal kontaktivormil on kordumatu ID ja Contact Form 7 lühikood ([contact-form-7 ...]). Kontaktivormi lisamiseks postitusse või tekstividinasse sisesta lühikood sihtkohta."

